    "answerHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-xs\">\n  <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-400\">RBI Master Circular - Asset Classification Benchmarks:</p>\n  <table class=\"w-full text-[11px] border-collapse border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr class=\"bg-slate-800/80 text-white\">\n        <th class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-700 text-left\">Facility Type</th>\n        <th class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-700 text-left\">NPA Classification Trigger</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">1. Term Loan</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Interest and/or installment of principal remains <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">overdue for &gt; 90 days</span>.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">2. CC / Overdraft</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Account remains <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">'Out of Order'</span>: Outstanding &gt; Sanctioned Limit/DP continuously for 90 days, OR No credits for 90 days, OR Credits &lt; Interest debited during the period.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">3. Agricultural Loan</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\"><span class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">Short-duration crop:</span> Overdue for 2 crop seasons.<br/><span class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">Long-duration crop:</span> Overdue for 1 crop season.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">4. Bills Purchased</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Bill remains overdue and unpaid for a period of <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">&gt; 90 days</span>.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">5. Credit Card</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Minimum Amount Due (MAD) is not paid within <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">90 days</span> from the next statement date.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-white\">6. Derivatives</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Overdue net receivables (positive MTM) remain unpaid for <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">&gt; 90 days</span>.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <div class=\"p-2 border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 rounded text-[11px] text-slate-300\">\n    <span class=\"font-bold text-sky-300 block\">Critical Borrower-Wise Rule:</span>\n    NPA classification is borrower-wise, not facility-wise. If any credit facility of a borrower turns NPA, all other facilities granted to that borrower must be treated as NPA.\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
    "summaryClean": "NPA triggers at 90 days overdue for Term Loans/CC-OD/Bills/Cards, 1 or 2 crop seasons for Agri, and applies on a borrower-wise basis across all accounts."
