    "answerHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-xs\">\n  <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-400\">Prudential Provisioning Matrix under RBI IRACP Norms:</p>\n  <table class=\"w-full text-[11px] border-collapse border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr class=\"bg-slate-800/80 text-white\">\n        <th class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-700 text-left\">Classification</th>\n        <th class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-700 text-left\">Time Horizon</th>\n        <th class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-700 text-left\">Mandatory Provision %</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-emerald-400\">Standard</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Performing / Regular</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">\u2022 General: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">0.40%</span><br/>\u2022 Commercial RE: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">1.00%</span><br/>\u2022 Resi RE: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">0.75%</span><br/>\u2022 Agri / SMEs: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">0.25%</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-amber-400\">Sub-Standard</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">NPA for &le; 12 months</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">\u2022 Secured: <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">15%</span><br/>\u2022 Unsecured ab-initio: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">25%</span> (Infra: 20%)</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-rose-400\" rowspan=\"3\">Doubtful (DA)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">D1: Up to 1 year</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Secured: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">25%</span> + Unsecured: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">100%</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">D2: 1 to 3 years</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Secured: <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">40%</span> + Unsecured: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">100%</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">D3: &gt; 3 years</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Secured: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">100%</span> + Unsecured: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">100%</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-rose-500\">Loss Asset</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\">Uncollectible / Identified</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1.5 border border-slate-800\"><span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">100% Provision</span> or write-off immediately.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-mono\">\n    *Unsecured portion in Doubtful category attracts 100% provision across all three tiers (D1, D2, and D3).\n  </p>\n</div>\n",
