    "answerHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-2.5 font-sans text-xs\">\n  <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-400\">RBI Resolution Framework Architecture:</p>\n  <pre class=\"font-mono text-[10px] p-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded\">\nDefault Detected\n  \u2502\n  \u251c\u2500\u25ba Day 0 to 30: Review Period (Evaluate resolution strategy)\n  \u2502    \u2514\u2500\u25ba Inter-Creditor Agreement (ICA) executed by all lenders\n  \u2502\n  \u2514\u2500\u25ba Day 31 to 180: Implementation Window (Implement Resolution Plan - RP)\n       \u2514\u2500\u25ba If RP not implemented within 180 days: Penal Provisioning Triggers\n  </pre>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-300 text-[11px]\">\n    <li><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">ICA Voting Threshold:</span> RP approved by lenders representing at least <span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-400\">75% of total outstanding credit by value</span> AND <span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-400\">60% of lenders by number</span> is binding on all signatory lenders.</li>\n    <li><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">Penal Accelerated Provisioning:</span>\n      <ul class=\"pl-4 list-circle space-y-0.5 mt-0.5\">\n        <li>After 180 days from default: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">Additional 20% provision</span>.</li>\n        <li>After 365 days from default: <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-400\">Additional 15% provision (Total 35% additional)</span>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n",
    "summaryClean": "ICA requires approval by 75% lenders by value and 60% by number within 180 days; delay triggers additional 20% provision at 180 days and 15% at 365 days."
